sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant ServiceCatalog
    participant CatalogDB
    participant Kafka

    User           ->>  ServiceCatalog      :   HTTP DELETE http://service-catalog/api/v1/books/{bookId}
    ServiceCatalog ->>  CatalogDB           :   findBookById
    alt Not Found
        CatalogDB      -->> ServiceCatalog  :   Null
        ServiceCatalog -->> User            :   HTTP 404 Not Found
    else BookEntity
        CatalogDB      -->> ServiceCatalog  :   BookEntity
        ServiceCatalog ->>  ServiceCatalog  :   check current status<br/>(e.g. cannot remove while BORROWED — TBD, see open question)
        alt Removal not allowed
            ServiceCatalog -->> User        :   HTTP 409 Conflict
        else Removal allowed
            ServiceCatalog ->>  CatalogDB   :   DELETE book (or soft-delete — TBD)
            CatalogDB      -->> ServiceCatalog : ok
            ServiceCatalog ->>  Kafka       :   publish BookStatusChangedEvent <br/>(bookId, status=REMOVED)
            Kafka          -->> ServiceCatalog : ack
            ServiceCatalog -->> User        :   HTTP 200 OK
        end
    end
